10. Recommendation engine
The recommendation engine should have a staged architecture.
10.1 Initial recommendation system
Start with explainable, database-backed recommendations.

Inputs:
- Followed artists.
- Liked tracks.
- Listening history.
- Listening duration.
- Completion rate.
- Skips.
- Repeated listening.
